        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kendrick Lamar\n- Works: “Money Trees”, Good Kid, M.A.A.D City, Section.80\n- Topics: albums, songs, release sequence\n\nFacts:\n- Section.80 is Kendrick Lamar’s debut studio album, and it was released in 2011 exclusively through the iTunes Store as an independent album.\n- Good Kid, M.A.A.D City is Kendrick Lamar’s second studio album.\n- Good Kid, M.A.A.D City was released in 2012 and is stylized as good kid, m.A.A.d city.\n- “Money Trees” is a song by American hip hop recording artist Kendrick Lamar.\n- “Money Trees” appears on Kendrick Lamar’s major-label debut studio album Good Kid, M.A.A.D City.",
